OL,3,GNEWSAHull launches rewards app for
OL,4,Agreener travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Hull could be rewarded for
OL,7,Fwalking, cycling and using public
OL,8,Ftransport.
OL,10,FHull City Council has teamed up with
OL,11,FBetterPoints to launch an app that
OL,12,Fallows users to log journeys without a
OL,13,Fcar and earn shopping vouchers in
OL,14,Freturn.
OL,16,FThe app will also give users the chance
OL,17,Fto win prizes, including a European
OL,18,Fcity break, or make charitable
OL,19,Fdonations.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
