OL,3,GNEWSAHull launches rewards app for
OL,4,Agreener travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it hoped the scheme
OL,7,Fwould encourage people to become more
OL,8,Factive, make healthier travel choices
OL,9,Fand help reduce noise pollution and
OL,10,Fcarbon emissions.
